     How would you handle returning to previously visited levels?
When you go back, all monsters there are checked to see whether
their species was genocided while you were away.  If so, their
gear is dropped and they're silently removed.  Explosions would
need to impact other monsters and potentially objects or terrain.
(I don't think gas spores affect either of the last two though,
but adjacent monsters should be damaged and nearby ones awakened.)

     Conceivably the hero could be temporarily blinded and made
deaf and have telepathy, warning, and Eyes of the Overworld all
blocked so that the normal explosion code could be used, but it
sounds like a lot of work with high risk for bugs to accommodate
something which would almost never get used.


